          "id": "p0-5",
          "kind": "quote",
          "page": 0,
          "order": 5,
          "text": "The gospel is the foundation of peace: it makes peace, but is not peace keeping."
        },
        {
          "id": "p0-6",
          "kind": "key_point",
          "page": 0,
          "order": 6,
          "text": "People resist the gospel not because it is false, but because they are at enmity with Christ."
