          "text": "Genuine love fulfills the law and draws others to Christ when we delight in seeing fellow believers blessed."
        },
        {
          "id": "p0-3",
          "kind": "key_point",
          "page": 0,
          "order": 3,
          "text": "Unity in fellowship requires showing forgiveness and humility toward people who are difficult."
        },
        {
          "id": "p0-4",
          "kind": "key_point",
          "page": 0,
          "order": 4,
          "text": "Admonishment begins with ourselves, aimed solely at Christ's glory and our neighbor's good."
        },
        {
          "id": "p0-5",
          "kind": "quote",
          "page": 0,
          "order": 5,
          "text": "Hiding, removing, covering offenses is from the\nfootsteps of Christ..."
